AutoFlow 1.2.1
• Flows that run other flows: risky steps in the called flow now ask for approval
• Scheduled flows can run flows that have no trigger of their own
• A step's time limit now stops a long press or swipe in progress
• Run notification shows the first step and the paused state
• Sync keeps restored flows, folders and favourites
• HTTP headers, tags and negative numbers can be typed in the editor
• Hotkeys keep Shift (Ctrl+Shift+K)
